  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is equal to _______.",
    "image": null
  },
